  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_ChrysalideRancor</defName>
    <label>chrysalide rancor</label>
    <description>The chrysalide (also known as the "chrysalis beast" or "chrysalide rancor"), was a creature created from rancors and altered by Sith alchemy. It was widely believed that during ancient times, the knowledge of creating the chrysalis beast was formed by the ancient Sith race. In those early years, the creatures served the Sith Empire as pets or protectors to high-ranking officers or powerful nobles. The knowledge for creating such monsters was later encoded within holocrons and other such tomes, which were buried on Sith worlds such as Korriban. Many believed that the knowledge of creating such fearsome beasts was lost. These creatures are stronger, tougher and grow much faster than their baseline kin. As a product of unstable Sith Alchemy, offspring of this creature has will revert back to the original Rancor stock.</description>
